# BUILD A PROFESSIONAL TRAINING RESOURCE PLANNER

Build a complete, functional, professional web application called:

# Training Resource Planner

Subtitle:

**Professional Training Scheduling & Resource Management**

The application is designed to manage and visualize training courses and the people assigned to them.

The primary purpose is:

> **To visually schedule training courses, assign people by role, immediately identify availability, and prevent a person from being assigned to more than one training on the same date.**

