# 22. CORE BUSINESS RULE

The most important rule in the application is:

# ONE PERSON = ONE TRAINING PER CALENDAR DAY

A person cannot be assigned to more than one training on the same calendar date.

This rule applies regardless of:

- Training time
- Role
- Location

Example:

