# 24. DATE RANGE CONFLICT LOGIC

A conflict exists when:

```text
existingStartDate <= newEndDate
AND
existingEndDate >= newStartDate
AND
personId is the same
```

If true:

🔴 CONFLICT

This is the PRIMARY scheduling rule.

---

# 25. TIME OVERLAP RULE

Also implement time overlap detection:

```text
existingStartTime < newEndTime
AND
existingEndTime > newStartTime
```

But the same-day rule has priority.

Therefore:

Same date + different times:

🔴 Conflict

Same date + overlapping times:

🔴 Conflict

Different dates:

🟢 Allowed

provided the date ranges do not overlap.

